OL,3,GNEWSAStarmer tells Dublin crowd Europe
OL,4,Acan no longer rely on US to 'bankroll'
OL,5,Aits defence
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Keir Starmer has said Europe should
OL,8,Fbuild a common security framework,
OL,9,Fwarning the change in its defence
OL,10,Frelationship with the US is permanent
OL,11,Frather than "an aberration of the Trump
OL,12,Fpresidency".
OL,14,FThe former prime minister was speaking
OL,15,Fat a British Irish Chamber of Commerce
OL,16,F(BICC) dinner in Dublin on Friday
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,19,FSir Keir said a "common security
OL,20,Fframework" for Europe was needed as
OL,21,Fmuch as a common market, with the UK at
OL,22,Fits centre.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
