OL,3,GNEWSAStarmer tells Dublin crowd Europe
OL,4,Acan no longer rely on US to 'bankroll'
OL,5,Aits defence
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe warned that "things will not go back
OL,8,Fto the way they were," adding that the
OL,9,FUS had made clear it will no longer
OL,10,F"bankroll" its European allies.
